  "implementation": [
    "Chromium publishes its Cocoa content minimum converted to outer-window dimensions in authenticated normal-tab inventory.",
    "Visible undersized browser layout requests fail preflight before tab transfer or window mutation.",
    "The helper reads native owner frame results after serialized AX writes, learns enforced minima, and rejects nonfinite/out-of-range observations.",
    "The shared planner distributes all integer points subject to owner minima. An infeasible split temporarily stacks its children without rewriting the persistent tree.",
    "Mixed tab navigation can reach root items during temporary stacking; workspace-direction focus uses actual planned frames."
  ],
